WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
You delegated a critical task to your AI agent. But it forgot yesterday's lesson, making the exact same mistake again today.

00:09.000 --> 00:20.000
AI agents are stateless execution tools. Once the session ends, all your corrections, lessons, and instructions vanish with the context.

00:20.000 --> 00:33.000
Principles Disciple captures your corrections and AI behavioral drift, crystallizing fragmented lessons into durable character for your AI agents. Auditable and reversible.

00:33.000 --> 00:45.000
Transform AI from a mere tool into a partner with character. Principles Disciple — Burn pain, co-evolve.
